{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1291,
  "batch_count": 1645,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "d2656fb43e00556ee3186c852692cfa26a722dbc",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:17178f3c22f07109933bfa53",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……大家都非常高兴啊。什么“眼福”啦，\n还有“尊爆”之类的……\n明明我只是早上向爱丽数码打了个招呼而已。",
      "source_fingerprint": "26b4551c676c62027177bba267849322862a8c4270e966f9786a589509cffb08",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "90011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cef5583fa432a7d9d745284f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "午饭……意大利面……蛋包饭……不，\n还是BLT三明治吧。不要加番茄酱，\n……沾到衣服上，会很麻烦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b9893a803ba77294619e7c440c48090697c6bf144326d5ddc1ee3b171af4dafb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "90012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1565abc6562c74258a6301c7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "怒涛……那孩子，今天也\n在吃着火红的咖喱……\n不过她看起来很幸福，应该没问题吧……",
      "source_fingerprint": "3a09ec7bd1b7f35166150b9521381bb83bbc574fc61727b267885fd4e45dd98a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "90013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c82bf59cc1338a6c9d885ffd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这身装扮，要配得上……\n要配得上那孩子，也要配得上我自己……\n……我再去，多跑一会儿吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "aa478738c62afa5f5f202a8a4731e4a831b01cdea713d10a9f40a158af7c8e37",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "90014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c8ca57b7d9c354aa9dfc3933",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "家用的天文馆投影仪，\n是以前父母送给我的。\n在看不见星星的夜晚，真的很有用。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fd85f085ac6d5fc5659c68438516c189aefe1062b0c1353268ec2f0d447d7317",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "90015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:60c1d36ff9df0e5af7db228e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "终于把被子烘干机换新了。\n提前查了一下春季促销，真是太好了。\n……这样，梅雨季就不用担心了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7bf2875b763bac7665deb523175c6744f6b3228f2f203be7e0a3d3ece8b2a3c3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "90016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e6d68b3b7d77f304a6e00007",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这个时候，总是被问到同一个问题。\n怎样才能让头发不炸开。\n……用护发素不是就够了吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "2c5c0069902712a63412a29801e13430c14276babd65870b50dfcf5c5e2ac7f3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "90017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b052137959888974b4cb9eb8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "山……要不要再去一次呢……\n这个季节，夜晚也很长……\n还能和那孩子，好好聊聊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6d42d47f3b4ccf594e314d743d40f1243aff7f805cece339d09ce06cff471cf3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "90018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:462035db241a74e2617f16b0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一起跑完步后，成田路给了我暖宝宝……\n明明她自己的鼻尖也冻得通红。\n真是的……真拿她没办法……",
      "source_fingerprint": "9e8b9170e6307578e1ab753ab25b86bc52676c41102bc4478c2db64c1f1d4ca7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "90019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3266212590091453e96a432e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐",
      "source_fingerprint": "9392c70765a5a96081978bc15cd29abd7d78628fdd8840f21389130a9a70469b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:90280b16b8756fe4ba7f5b09",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐",
      "source_fingerprint": "9392c70765a5a96081978bc15cd29abd7d78628fdd8840f21389130a9a70469b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "90021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fd79179e75b725ead7ec57ad",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……不用勉强自己找话题的。\n我讨厌现在这样拼命找话说的气氛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a2a79b85ca6c42840869e7ecdc61c280bb6a6771403216ae627f467de39f804f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:092b08c6ae14edc897661129",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……我写的字，\n好像和妈妈和外婆一样，\n都会向右下倾斜。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d39b97c41bae450514bf9262b7f0d6acdf5d119d745ea84bd0a68066c4d9ae5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:82b6b4fd295329d56525ee28",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "歌剧王发来了『紧急联络』？\n请无视掉吧。\n我讨厌被卷入她一时兴起的杂事中。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ae43177468075e7f9717bac692793c91a8994baf8c0f2d171f35c17901ad6a5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dc17310ab196da518fa63fbe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "怒涛好像明天想和我并跑训练。\n……反正对我们双方都有益，\n考虑一下也没什么损失。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d2e69af29b6efea159a6e9d55415e17364ec491d295e49ee62e00285fbcec185",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7ba2b0a75b0140c376db9aff",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "头发和尾巴都有些自己保养不到\n的地方……但是去美容院\n又太浪费时间了……哈啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f52322bcbee07cdedc82f7578ee68648ac1164cf22a6892cd8a99eed9091ec9d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fc3fcc5bdac1307b63ec798d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果站在舞台上的话……\n为了将笑容传递给粉丝们，\n也得鼓起勇气唱歌。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fe8e54901b70c73767a9f8d8e0c2b456f4b692c130c62bc7a350206ceaad0c0c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:838a9b6d844ec7d9bdc59976",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……和大家穿一样的衣服我倒是没什么意见。\n但是，腹部的布料会不会太少了点？",
      "source_fingerprint": "3faed23ad0f183b83cabe9f0c5ff8c7a96897475a85fbc66966ff20129f9b8a5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4eebef32d716ac2b5512bff2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……哼哼……啦啦啦……\n啦啦……——啊。\n哈啊……你还在啊……",
      "source_fingerprint": "629d2df274ca0d03e92c00561cb34fd5feb07545672303464e37298319f6246d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4615f1d7911c764302a77b45",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……能让我进行宣誓的仪式的，\n只有一个人。我绝不会把王冠\n交给那个瞎闹的霸王大人……",
      "source_fingerprint": "1d95f887544ebd1067812b8594fc61166e7f9696190d353e85435dcb7a824925",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7ef761f34410e7a370531d46",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……卡莲同学很奇怪呢。\n明明每次都是被闹铃声吵起来的，\n却说我像个姐姐一样照顾她……很奇怪啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f19b5a38d9772dd60070b53cfedb4cde26906ea3c575c0f2460b355f54d55617",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1980a947dbcc32c9d1151018",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "午休时成田路同学也一直忙着\n帮别人……既然是休息时间的话，\n先以自己的休息为重才好吧……",
      "source_fingerprint": "ee48449bd1092f8bcec46caaae6b33fde18f4a783f2b257732751a4615b92743",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:07aea9594fbd74b2f1cd0e2c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……原来如此，要比一比啊。  \n……那就来跑吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0256542e908f50252128ed8e937f73e68ed3d85dd7581716a684a43fb7077205",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "910100"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8ed2bda9683c0f8d8568d9dc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "左手好像有点肿……\n睡前的伸展运动得小心点……",
      "source_fingerprint": "c5b335c4a4dbe8ccda2cc49d02b429e1d413ebc78765c1d8b11a1d81a003416a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0fa2ac232457aee50541f256",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "白天也变得越来越久了呢。\n要不要也延长下训练的时间呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5ad4a98f537edb823db50a82c3c9e26a9448c810e7ce89c4251710dab50e1dec",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b087d566fe0b2c7b83b5edea",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……既然没什么大比赛的话，\n要进步就趁现在了。\n而且，秋天可是……",
      "source_fingerprint": "6ccace6d71d96a2a977cf572825f23329d5ef41a6e1d4a2db5fa58854d4e0db7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:795f601d6771ec5d80bda273",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最近变得挺冷了呢……\n差不多该把羊绒围巾拿出……\n啊，还早吗。",
      "source_fingerprint": "826f33a8ff4c4a458476bf4111b316709d5967a7b7d745ab091c918322253f6a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d82ce06a3a16ed83bd4f5dd8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……不管外边有多冷，\n拥有电热毯的我现在都是毫无破绽。\n今晚，暖呼呼软绵绵的被子也在等着我。",
      "source_fingerprint": "94fa260512740597029250a54d7bf8b32e6714a7d926531a3154fc8c350054f5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4f57d39b0c5b83bd53ba4b86",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……呐。你之前好像在搜懒人沙发吧，\n打算放在哪里呢？是放在训练员办公室吗？\n还有，品牌是哪家的？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e7f71df0d968a8f0037e78913d8c07837703f0c37db8b0eedb53c7529238883c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "91016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cda0119426641b003eb6fbeb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "『爱织』这个称呼，\n最开始也就只有成田路会这么叫我，\n没想到现在会传开成这样。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dc58c10d55859a80c1d6a0ecf63b17b44d0c179f00f3040d85ee39653d64879c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "91017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ebfbed073c6e06760143d045",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……这种打扮，算是名媛风吗？\n要说闪闪发光的话……\n强击的眼睛，更耀眼吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8a17ee9c88d8dc63a05f446ca5d1035f530199882624c279544d39ebdc39d3fc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "91018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f59af15c556291d9aeafdaf1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…信念同学。有时候比我还要练得晚，\n她那种坚持的态度，我也得向她学习才行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "16e66cbc01c3ad979b219730ce95664d4d24f188201854273f0a8672c0971583",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "91019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:34596e79f7cb78b6c541469e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "圣诞老人为什么要选驯鹿做搭档呢？\n如果只是拉雪橇的话，\n西伯利亚哈士奇也可以吧……",
      "source_fingerprint": "444b03d5771115ce0047a6082b28b06f532d341b87724868b370a7062e4aa185",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "91020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4ddb864355533ed11c582432",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "因为演出需要才穿成这样的……\n大家的视线……要是我能连心也\n变成『冰之女王』就好了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "1f9262343c4876b4622995181ae1fadcf305bd9c837e0d33e4c3b15716b0b984",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "91021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6040fb4ed018faa492fbf0c7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "和茶座同学一起做的饼干……\n还剩下些……给你吧。很配咖啡的。\n……午休时间的话，你也该休息一下吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "80c56006abf6232c8fad631a41c85e40b0a8d844ad3fe4f19c9171f787e68534",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "91022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f40a4e0e96d261c291d604b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "明明已经拒绝了好几次……还是被\n邀请去参加晚宴秀、歌剧。\n……唉。也许去了反而更轻松。",
      "source_fingerprint": "967b69f996d858c75b51347922b4f24b3757545b0bff57c3e3277730fc97168d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "91023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ebd7771585f9d0854ab0d43f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "雪已经融化，春天悄然来临——\n如今，冰之女王也该到沉睡的季节了。\n……不过，我还没有打算从舞台上退场。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5ea70fca166f03780d5954e71edf412bd42d96510e31b8b53fd4cb1af5af6081",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "91024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9d438f66f9faa5415c364c13",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……什么？看起来我很热吗？  \n我才没有勉强自己……\n才没，有呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "a8dd8bfd050da213134a78fa44c1016348ce4cf25843eee1f9e7169bf8b1b05d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "91025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5e7f62e9839135d4c5139513",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……喂。我想读的那本书的续集，\n你是不是借走了？  \n……真是个温柔、的人呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6b242b294265c00395696f78ab6fe1a44671d9eb8b6ef9fd8baa22d2a157cc4d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "91026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:813753ea4bb4e8ec2c847dda",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "圣诞树顶的星星，我并不需要……\n比起那个，我更想珍惜，\n那在天空中闪烁的光。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b9d7f743e4afdbb1508065a38497415036a3b3c2732483a609a6d91c17cc1d0f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "91027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7fe8ddbb6979319c0630490f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……我觉得这件衣服很漂亮。  \n毛绒绒的部分……  \n既温暖，手感也很好……嗯。",
      "source_fingerprint": "16203a88f84af6369b5023350a45dd732172361e08022e8de21dfda9c0565391",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "91028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5310cc8d1f0530c85e7829e8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "姑且还是配合服装，把发型也……\n虽然不太擅长细细打理……\n不过，这次还算做得不错",
      "source_fingerprint": "e2a8fa63c44bfb78b8a08f7ee8f091c317bbf9c74deaa3ac662fba0b02f9e8ac",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "91029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d1c78655c2b7bd4e6ca998e5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我不是为了跟你打好关系\n才和你组队的。\n……好了，说说训练的话题吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9952fca145b264c304cb5339b4dd55b4cece80092ebf9df6f623b9e0330389d4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b0f97a990514b3a5f97946e8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "やってみせる！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a17db497fe38ad60213894b8f1d2500836fc0eb571f4ca580a905b730c349743",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8db04d8a67a616d1b827f24a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "更快……再快一些……！\n为了获胜，必须要再快些……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c49ad35a8ae6b06ef221c5749f15e9cc88bd7a0029b5729c73d8ca0830de7184",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:250430f94ab86ce9db065c46",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就算是训练，我也会全力奔跑。\n……因为她将能够奔跑的身体赠与了我……",
      "source_fingerprint": "481c2da962dcf1cab03b71b7945c93c247a26a3332af2d0f7fa43f3c178043b8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:44d41a0a27f8763510ba7953",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果没什么特别的指示的话，\n我就开始自主训练了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ddc90bcd4b4a881469a69aca8f9cc36b5026296a94a757ca6e6b5d7b1dfaadc6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f993efe228425c2354cee65b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "表面温度愈高，\n星星的表面也就越会显出蓝色。\n我的内心、我的愿望也——",
      "source_fingerprint": "755b2d0af64c09dbf25c35e7575959b3912dbb928b89b043ee30ffa4ce051ef8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5d6720bf0b3908d27a740be5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "若是低头的话，便永远看不见她的身影……\n所以，要向前……向上看。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c63d94c4e228d708c162fa6cbba1b17757205e41b50f717ef2db71a484dcb451",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ad26b0afb0743ab1f3b40f2b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "与我竞争的对手是太阳也好，是月亮也罢……\n我已经下定决心，\n一定要为她献上不会输给任何人的光辉。",
      "source_fingerprint": "71defac6b42f3cb14a1ebe3a911a4522508e3ff8d8a7918c7a8ac2bb49c9ea0f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8b1087eddc62dd6c97114380",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……和夜晚的海滨截然不同，\n到处都吵吵嚷嚷的呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0d8d4f89b427ade90aa6270b4190227f2e5fee7364a914aca7cd610779170906",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d7965ade8ccd180e05692ea6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要是为了那个孩子，我都愿意。\n成为绝不会被任何人融化的——\n冰之女王。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fc307ed6c4db741d32a9034f0cc8bd0205bb6e0412f58805f9ae9aede5a111ca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "92015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:18c53ded8826c0c42f834c74",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在雪道上锻炼耐力，\n一定也不错。如果要起个名字的话……\n也许可以叫做圣诞老人训练吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab7d5b8303842517e0d5bb641f3d0109074669630dac2ff0ebb691b5550ecb25",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "92016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6528bb5558c37de1765c9ec9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这胜利的礼物。\n一定要、由我……交给那孩子。",
      "source_fingerprint": "03136bf8dafe2a1551a30e26092d96bfaa515c377142ea9d5b5ee30f9b112f1a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "92017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b9911079d96bb95082ca5a8b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赶紧开始吧。\n……和往常一样。你会\n支援我的，对吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "57594311edb2a322ad43647666f706cde6d6a716ebb1e5f1e2535658d76a0899",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "92018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:752e0e2b7d21c81ff0384fc9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不断奔跑。穿越寒冷刺骨的夜晚。\n必须对那孩子有所回报——\n因为，还没有开始融雪啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5277dbeee094de5f41daa24dc3f601e68847b38de14051320e71451e0e537ec3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "92020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a214f8d0d4eeebc1c225250d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论多么黑暗、没有星星的夜晚，  \n我都能够忍受。  \n只要这份愿望，还在我心中点亮着。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d873733b440bee88dbb09300a4a634b0a5181adc65eef14718707d78b51f719b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "92021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b5523fc3bfedd11af542bac0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的手……大概像冰一样吧。\n即便如此，你还是握住了。\n明明随时都可以放开的……真傻啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e5da4c5cb95dfbc7dbf2f760b0add445f303dbf11bd689aeb551b22593570ded",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "92022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ff8a230187abbfc6222ccecb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……大概……多亏有你在吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "137d1fea998951c6f7ab1883d50e76dbf0009849517cef772c298bb364e13d84",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df939d9c14c2b0d66b38ccf3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……跑得……非常棒……\n我的心愿，是否有传达给她呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3c02f348109ca19e44107668c8d320963ad1aeed42613d5ccc533c22384a6869",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cb5d84183415d271b64cedc6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "照亮雪夜的月亮。……那就是你啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c802daad38b646149749f1d5cbb7aab5101d789c183e3d532ee4ee2363fe53f6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "93004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1cd3d270654f34e97cd9cc57",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "连感受寒冷的时间都没有呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "19c9b84d0bc21fbe9718af312806d3c7c6bf6deccd1e965b7f8ccb3b3585e01a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "93005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cad2be9d929ecfbf6a672a0f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要有这份力量的话……",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f19c696195a74ea8acef8fb45278c0427c54e331157e918809af13e676e88ce",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b61ed4a0b8d1ef4480beb2fb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不断将手伸向前方的话，\n终有一日……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e45bc36c935127c7b6cf1e67f24cea6b06be8e73d2b22edb32e89218b83280b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4a11e3faed859696c182ec54",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……爱慕织姬。快点开始训练吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ef5b2f779ac253855004bf670448cf4f69fe7f386a0fe7652de0f6b168afe5d2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:266d7b85ee48a0c468ba13cb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要用这双脚……亲自赢下献给她的星星！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9e91c98fd4b0ad986fecfbdd69b6a6820d7566104a12afdecf853381dd79d028",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bbb3a348f6ed448ed1639102",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像比起过去，变的更强了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "15852b163f45f5f57adc28e1f37f246cb669ccf22f4510a7c5944a60d27be3c9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f43dfd6e0ca74b574a51d97f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我不会辜负期待……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8bbf08bd01fd2cead2a454232862a5e34b6dc095ff06c99b7984b0ff6384fd3b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a8ae26ca773c90380d9f90c2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就像壁炉一样，好暖和……",
      "source_fingerprint": "fe642066023d902980d1502debcda3170d6aaa285d95db42c6a143a127d724c4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "95007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c71bda991a192ea9045abb57",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这样的话，连奇迹也……",
      "source_fingerprint": "11cbff4e75512777bf53bfbd4a0b0e32e883bb534317c1097986dcce26301c96",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "95008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8745e56bbaa849718f460b1c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来，开拓道路吧。  \n为了我，也为了我的同胞。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4af95cff63e5f7f98b79d18cec2a30f06b1c8a62561fecd27563ddcbbc996e1e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "95009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7596dd4373ab7456966c2e16",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…爱慕织姬。\n…即使是暴风雪，我也会跨越。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d52ee9903b3cd78b139603ffe3116e0afc9cd5fc6a98be320c028331f548c00b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "95010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d0edd4e48bbfde544c424dde",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我上场了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "092de8b679dc1d62be9d0345f00b41ce5d39669391cc434ea8f1c32929be88df",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a88406725e73ba91796c1f34",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不管怎么说，你还是带我\r\n登上了有趣的舞台。\r\n你真是个了不起又讨喜的人呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8716fc1dd0ac5eb53515c47739fdb1b0111bfe54f0df84967c8d3abfaa4f8f7e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:473681525de66405760c3f47",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行ってくるぜい。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4dff48f1da859e52a685f16896f34008da7a843350e60cd751d1f26011c52110",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b555ba64327c415007ad5dd6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ただいま。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c3d9f2c221a037f0a2eb9da22145532ea4b422af42c29694227631ad74c073f2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bb71f9f47646c99c1c92b1a9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "托你的福，我才能尽情和强大的\r\n赛马娘进行热血的较量。\r\n嘿嘿，真是太感谢了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c67a40e6ebedd351c8e9c4c6930aa79c7a9c504da423658fb557e60bf5a39791",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aedf148ed614a368bd87084a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要好好和搭档同心协力，\r\n就不会独自冲过头。\r\n嘿嘿，真是可靠呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "86af8a73b449d1795f2b40bda3286c7beb5a975e87f1dbeb376dc77e97602d4a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b0a9d14709c37ca1385eabbb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然新年在家好好休息也不错，\r\n但我果然还是坐不住！\r\n要不要一起打板羽球？",
      "source_fingerprint": "8ab5da1e73e266792bf999a7fea62adf2424a96b3105769041873651e1947308",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a7ce858976fab88ccca5cf4e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我常去的日式点心店，\r\n推出了巧克力日式馒头。\r\n一起吃吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6bed02ab521c92bdc1da82e0bcb9202a2f9ea396142e577dce185f68cb788616",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "10004"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
